WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400 line:5% size:90%
Firstly, we select four hundred grams of soft tofu, then cut the tofu into small squares about 1.2 centimeters.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:14.280 line:5% size:90%
First, add an appropriate amount of salt to the tofu bowl, then pour boiling water at 90 degrees into the bowl. Let the tofu soak for five minutes and set aside.
